    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generations have passed since the infamous deeds of the mighty Lowlander. Now the realm needs another hero -- will you be the one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The evil enchantress, Yarak, means business. She ain't got time for you! Get that armor on - there's adventuring to be done!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729250/extras/60f35c9ed8134676a54cc9919599a636.avif?t=1752944806\" width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lowlander II: Lowerlander harkens back to the early days of personal computers \u2014 specifically the awesome early Ultima games by Richard Garriott! If you\u2019ve been looking to get your nostalgia on, but can\u2019t be bothered to use two hands doing it, then this is the game for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- glorious one handed retro-RPG action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- approximately 16 hours of minimalist adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- explore a huge world, gain experience and rise in power</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- delve into dark dungeons for loot and riches</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- customize your character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- save your game and resume it later!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- no in-app purchases. buy once, own forever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- over 8 colors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- realistic moving water!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generations have passed since the infamous deeds of the mighty Lowlander. Now the realm needs another hero -- will you be the one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The evil enchantress, Yarak, means business. She ain't got time for you! Get that armor on - there's adventuring to be done!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729250/extras/60f35c9ed8134676a54cc9919599a636.avif?t=1752944806\" width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lowlander II: Lowerlander harkens back to the early days of personal computers \u2014 specifically the awesome early Ultima games by Richard Garriott! If you\u2019ve been looking to get your nostalgia on, but can\u2019t be bothered to use two hands doing it, then this is the game for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- glorious one handed retro-RPG action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- approximately 16 hours of minimalist adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- explore a huge world, gain experience and rise in power</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- delve into dark dungeons for loot and riches</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- customize your character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- save your game and resume it later!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- no in-app purchases. buy once, own forever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- over 8 colors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- realistic moving water!</p>",
